{"logId": "ee155ebf-83f1-4737-8879-c0e794146597", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 998, "height": 412, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": true, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我叫李贞。", "block_bbox": [0, 0, 998, 32], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[0.0, 0.0], [998.0, 0.0], [998.0, 32.0], [0.0, 32.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "維特鲁姆星优秀毕业生，同时也是維特鲁姆星的叛徒。", "block_bbox": [0, 42, 707, 82], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[0.0, 42.0], [707.0, 42.0], [707.0, 82.0], [0.0, 82.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "这个⽂明太残酷了，残酷到让我忍不住怀念上辈⼦在地球平平安安的⽇⼦。", "block_bbox": [0, 91, 972, 131], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[-1.132798358493615e-15, 91.0], [971.0, 91.0], [971.0, 128.0], [0.0, 128.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "为此，我在成人礼的这一天，做了一个重大决定。", "block_bbox": [0, 141, 648, 179], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[0.0, 141.0], [648.0, 141.0], [648.0, 179.0], [0.0, 179.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "趁着其他维特鲁姆预备役战士在征服了一颗星球后的松懈时刻。", "block_bbox": [0, 189, 817, 227], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[0.0, 189.0], [817.0, 189.0], [817.0, 227.0], [0.0, 227.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "从破败不堪的倒霉星球上抢了一艘飞船，打算前往地球，去过一段悠闲时光。", "block_bbox": [0, 236, 986, 275], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[-1.0, 236.0], [986.0, 236.0], [986.0, 275.0], [-1.0, 275.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "哪怕事后被维特鲁姆星清算。", "block_bbox": [0, 285, 371, 321], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[0.0, 285.0], [371.0, 285.0], [371.0, 321.0], [0.0, 321.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "但当我千辛万苦终于抵达了地球附近时，一个从未在我意料当中的家伙出现了。\n这个地球为什么会有超人啊？！", "block_bbox": [0, 332, 998, 412], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[0, 332], [0, 411], [997, 409], [997, 332]]}], "doc_preprocessor_res": {"model_settings": {"use_doc_orientation_classify": true, "use_doc_unwarping": true}, "angle": 0}, "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.46423739194869995, "coordinate": [0, 0, 998, 32], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[0.0, 0.0], [998.0, 0.0], [998.0, 32.0], [0.0, 32.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.3739565908908844, "coordinate": [0, 0, 134, 31], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[0, 0], [0, 30], [133, 30], [133, 0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7779631018638611, "coordinate": [0, 42, 707, 82], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[0.0, 42.0], [707.0, 42.0], [707.0, 82.0], [0.0, 82.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6400651335716248, "coordinate": [0, 91, 972, 131], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[-1.132798358493615e-15, 91.0], [971.0, 91.0], [971.0, 128.0], [0.0, 128.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6939396262168884, "coordinate": [0, 141, 648, 179], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[0.0, 141.0], [648.0, 141.0], [648.0, 179.0], [0.0, 179.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7604078650474548, "coordinate": [0, 189, 817, 227], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[0.0, 189.0], [817.0, 189.0], [817.0, 227.0], [0.0, 227.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6905977129936218, "coordinate": [0, 236, 986, 275], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[-1.0, 236.0], [986.0, 236.0], [986.0, 275.0], [-1.0, 275.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.5949835181236267, "coordinate": [0,